  "id": "failure-to-thrive",
  "term": "failure to thrive",
  "definition": "Failure to thrive is a state of undernutrition in children in which they do not keep up the expected rate of growth for their age and sex on growth charts. It is linked with later health and developmental problems, including short stature, cognitive difficulties, and behavioral abnormalities.",
